      "originalText": "README.md \u2014 purpose + paths\nAGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md \u2014 operating rules\nBROWSER.md \u2014 dedicated browser workflow\n.env.example \u2014 expected local settings\nrequirements*.txt \u2014 Python dependencies\n.mcp.json + .pi/ \u2014 agent integrations",
